# shiv.me -- ARCHIVED

Personal site. Plain static HTML in `src/`, served in dev by a small
Bun server (`dev.ts`) with live reload.

## Dev

    bun run dev          # http://localhost:3000

(or `bun run dev.ts` directly)

## Layout

- `src/`            — web root; everything here is served as-is.
  - `src/css/`      — stylesheets (`style.css`)
  - `src/js/`       — scripts (`site.js`)
  - `src/cv/`       — résumé / CV
  - `src/projects/` — project pages
  - `CNAME`, `.nojekyll` — GitHub Pages custom domain + Jekyll opt-out
- `dev.ts`          — dev server + live reload
- `Makefile`        — `make dev | build | check | deploy | clean`
- `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — publishes `src/` to GitHub Pages on push to `master`

## Notes

- No build step. Edit files in `src/` and refresh.
- The old stasis/haml generator was removed; the site is hand-written HTML/CSS now.
